        {
          "text": "Ngoba njengalokhu uJona waba sesiswini sensikabayitshiye insuku ezintathu lobusuku obuthathu, ngokunjaloke iNdodana yomuntu izakuba semathunjini omhlaba insuku ezintathu lobusuku obuthathu.",
